      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re going to change audio state with audioSuspend/audioResume, is it still necessary to do this here?\n\nIn this case, we\u0027re duplicating the call of UpdateAudioActiveStateOnSubgroups?\ne.g. OnAudioSuspend -\u003e called once -\u003e switch state to configured -\u003e at line 1051, we called again.",
