      "writtenOn": "2024-06-21T09:24:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMHO yes. As we discuss we set in announcement audio active state:\nTRUE when BIG and AUDIO_ACTIVE and FALSE otherwise.\nBecause of that we have to check it and set it in 4 places: audio resume/suspend, BIG created/terminated.\nWe cannot be sure if resume/created and suspend/terminated will be always in the same time, i.e. after onAudioSuspend will be timeout to terminate BIG.\n\nTo simplify that check is inside UpdateAudioActiveStateInPublicAnnouncement and logic there prevent to unnecessary updating announcement, line 347.",
